######## origin/dev
--- mock/DESIGN.md.tmpl, the foundations-crate sentence
  50:Each step names its foundations crate dependency: `arvo-bitmask` for set ops, `arvo-graph` for 
  DAG / RCM, `arvo-sparse` for CSR DependencyGraph (bench-locked canonical at all N), `arvo-spectral` 
  for the Fiedler partition step, `arvo-comb` for the cost DP.
--- mock/crates/hilavitkutin/DESIGN.md.tmpl, the spectral step
  64:7. Spectral partitioning → spectral `FiberGrouping` via an engine-local
  65- symmetric Laplacian over arvo-spectral's k-way partitioning, run over
  66- the live-node-count-aware (loose-CSR-correct) Laplacian. Step 8's
  67- width-gate consumes it for wide blocks (arvo-spectral).

